{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C4\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C3\", \"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C4最均衡，既保留了v6的投入、力量、骄傲和倾尽全力的快乐，又把残留的牵挂、自我控制和不甘心串成了清楚的心理过程。keep：C3略胜C4，因为它更明确地写出尽力本身带来的快乐、不再时时审视自己，以及仍有一部分心没有跟上高昂；C4紧随其后，C1和C2则都遗漏了继续给予、投入的畅快等重要内容。cover：C3最能把旧日珍惜之物只能留在心里、努力压下失落、反复撑起自己又泄劲连起来，尤其贴合B1、B3和B5；C4对B4的强撑和自我说服表现得更直接。lean：C2的心理步骤最少，推进直接；C4虽然内容更丰富，但各步都有作用；C1的重新提劲与前面的劝自己撑住略有重复，C3则有些拆碎，尤其行动后的几个心理状态可以合并。plain：C4的想把能给的都给出去、努力让自己显得没事，都像一个人在讲自己的处境，具体而有行动感；C2语言简洁自然，但把心思压回眼前稍显刻意；C1的说不清的珍贵东西略虚，C3的承担自己能做的那部分、心里的不满有了去处则更像概括性的心理分析。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d1090bc5-b689-4685-8a05-db8950c0fe4f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T013411146526Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.938, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:35:04.094783+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0defa403f230e1dbebb5934401f20a87fbaaf97816a6add331d867e84c09cb3c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "att